    {
      "id": 116,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        1300,
        470
      ],
      "size": [
        600,
        400
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 1,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Note: MiniMax H3",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 1080p / 10 秒 / 双图参考\n\n硬件：RTX 5080 16GB，系统内存 48GB。\n\nPicture 1 = Mario；Picture 2 = 城堡。修改图片和提示词后运行。\n\nH3 生成尺寸 1920×1088；编码前上下各裁 4 像素，输出 1920×1080。没有低清放大。\n\n10 秒对应 243 帧 / 24fps = 10.125 秒。Ref2VA FP8 + Ref2V Turbo 4 步。\n\n这是高负载配置，运行状态、耗时与限制见 docs/test-1080p-48gb.md。"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
